{"unit_id":"TPSCE__dsh-side-assistant#card-zh","repo":"TPSCE/dsh-side-assistant","commit":"bcb38211565b0bc46a56f2036bdb69ca7be6299d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-side-assistant 是面向 DSH 网页端的侧边助手，在会话标题栏提供入口，并在右侧栏打开独立对话。它为新助手整理主会话历史摘要，并持续提供主 Agent 的步骤、工具和后台任务进展，方便用户在主任务继续运行时提问。面板支持多个助手、进度展开查看、快捷提问，以及模型、上下文预算和回答风格设置。适合需要边观察长任务边询问当前进度的网页会话用户；可跟随主模型，也能选择宿主模型或自定义兼容端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1387-1404","index.js:1874-1900","client.js:1651-1670","client.js:2481-2518"]}
{"unit_id":"TPSCE__dsh-side-assistant#card-en","repo":"TPSCE/dsh-side-assistant","commit":"bcb38211565b0bc46a56f2036bdb69ca7be6299d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-side-assistant adds an independent chat to DSH's web sidebar. It gives the assistant a summary of the main session and ongoing progress, so users can ask questions while work continues. The panel supports multiple assistants, expandable progress, quick prompts, and model settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1387-1404","index.js:1874-1900","client.js:1651-1670","client.js:2481-2518"]}
