{"unit_id":"TPSCE__dsh-side-assistant#feature-1","repo":"TPSCE/dsh-side-assistant","commit":"bcb38211565b0bc46a56f2036bdb69ca7be6299d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-side-assistant 的功能「实时进展」：在侧栏顶部订阅主会话进度流，显示 Agent 当前步骤及工具活动，并可展开查看最近记录。打开对应会话面板后自动呈现。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1651-1670"]}
