{"unit_id":"TPSCE__dsh-side-assistant#feature-4","repo":"TPSCE/dsh-side-assistant","commit":"bcb38211565b0bc46a56f2036bdb69ca7be6299d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-side-assistant 的功能「自定义模型」：在设置页选择继承主会话模型、指定宿主模型或自定义兼容端点，并配置上下文预算与回答风格。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2099-2108","index.js:1723-1760"]}
